WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:04,030
Aren't you tired after scolding me for so long?

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:05,790
I didn't expect you to care about me so much

3
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:18,690
I have sent so many voice messages in a row. How about another one? Brother, do you have potatoes, real or fake? Can you exchange them? I have wood. Brother, exchange some potatoes. I have stones. How many stones do you have?

4
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:22,010
My place is a mine with lots of rocks.

5
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,570
I'll have as much as you want

6
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:27,250
Just gotta mine it, mine man

7
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:29,970
Dude, you're in luck

8
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,810
It's a pity that the strange stone spirit patrol here is here.

9
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,570
in the midst of a breakdown

10
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:34,890
Not much at all

11
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:37,410
It's no use having a single stone, bro.

12
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,410
How do you change your potatoes?

13
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,850
He actually guards a mine

14
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,370
If you want a home, you can’t deliver it.
